  "aggro": {},
  "zone": "mulgore",
  "removed": false,
  "infobox": "",
  "info": {},
  "coords": [],
  "sections": {
   "Description": "\"Ironforge - the Awakening of the Dwarves\" is a section of the History of Warcraft, Chapter II. It is set 2,500 years before Warcraft: Orcs & Humans. \n\nFound at:\n- Hall of Explorers in Ironforge.\n- Stoutlager Inn in Thelsamar, Loch Modan.\n- The Domicile in Blackrock Depths\n- Bael'dun Keep in Bael Modan, Southern Barrens\n- Bael'dun Digsite in Mulgore\n- Southmoon Ruins in Tanaris\n\nTimeline: \n- ← Previous book: The Guardians of Tirisfal\n- → Next book: The Seven Kingdoms",
   "Notes": "The site version incorrectly uses \"became\" in place of \"become\" in the sentence \"Their rocky hides had softened and become smooth skin\"."
  },
